urce of crop rendering.\n\n## Open questions (worker's)\nDefault viewport size + max; glyph design for stacked/multi-cell things;\nfind-rect scoring function; how pawns render on the grid.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Scripted session places a 5×7 room's corner sight-unseen on a fresh map\n  using ONLY find-rect/nearest/reachable (no raw arithmetic), verified valid.\n- Edge crops verified at all four map edges.\n- Landmark set → save → load → resolves identically.\n- A wave-3 mutation echo (stubbed) shows correct before/after crops.","files":null}]}